// Position matrix (design 235), grid 2 — `mod.STATIC` × place window, tested
// through an element write on a fixed array (`mod.ARR[i] = v`), plus the FIELD
// hop (`mod.CELL.v = v`) that reaches storage inside a qualified static.
//
// This is the exact shape DF-232d's original matrix marked working and design
// 235's grid 2 found is not: it ICE'd in codegen, one layer below the
// typechecker gap the finding was filed on. Both hops now resolve the
// qualified static's global as the root and GEP from there.
//
// EXPECT: success
// EXPECT-OUTPUT:
// 41
// 42
// 7
